"Working-with-nodes/Understanding-ROS2-Nodes/Understanding-ROS2-Nodes>` and :"
"doc:`topics <../../../topics/Understanding-ROS2-Topics/Understanding-ROS2-"
"Topics>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/actions/Working-with-actions/Understanding-ROS2-Actions/Understanding-ROS2-Actions.rst:34
msgid ""
"You will need the :doc:`turtlesim package <../../../../../Get-Started/"
"Introducing-Turtlesim/Introducing-Turtlesim>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/actions/Working-with-actions/Understanding-ROS2-Actions/Understanding-ROS2-Actions.rst:37
msgid "Steps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/actions/Working-with-actions/Understanding-ROS2-Actions/Understanding-ROS2-Actions.rst:40
msgid ""
